	(text "PICO PIN MAP\nCandles 1-4, 6-9: PWM on GP0, 2, 4, ..., 14 and button on GP1, 3, 5, ..., 15 (candle order)\nCandle 5 (shamash): button on GP16, PWM on GP17 (slice 0 B; all nine PWMs are on distinct slices/channels)\nButtons: enable internal pull-ups; pressed = low\nGP18: LASER_EN (master laser-rail switch)   GP19: CONFIG jumper (open = config A, closed = config B)\nGP26/ADC0: LASER_RAIL monitor   GP27/ADC1: VIN monitor   Spare: GP20-22, GP28\nPower-up rule: set every PWM to 0 before changing LASER_EN; ramp PWM only once ADC0 shows the rail is up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06dfb944-425b-451c-ad1a-89ffb19a41cc")
	)
